      "text": "I've long said the U.S. grows the best agricultural products in the world, we just had to get out and hustle to move them out. \n\nCurrent corn export inspections are up 77% over the five-year average, and we've just had two of the best weeks for exports ever! 🇺🇸🌽 \n\nPROGRESS! But so much more to do.  We won’t stop. Thank you @POTUS, @USTradeRep, @howardlutnick, and @SecScottBessent. \n\n#Teamwork #MAGA #USAgriculture #CornExports",
